          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I identified the Racine work order and September’s exact Pending Close timestamp. However, the available records contain no cost-event rows, and the supporting-records service reports that its input was not staged. I’m checking whether the missing evidence can be made available before drawing a conclusion about the event or its accounting status.",
