      "name": "supervisor_report",
      "arguments": "{\"text\":\"Blocked on missing source staging for job r_82d68b66b8052b29814b9e7f (worker_0a2cff2b978f). Public resource r_684ca74feb1a664f1f59a705 read successfully: actual contents are 24 work_orders and 5 cost_periods plus Oracle Pending Close policy, but zero work_order_cost_events (confirmed data_query group_count). Target is MO-25-09-1070 / WO-2025-09-004, Racine SITE-US-WI-RACINE-DEKOVEN-1500, period PER-COST-2025-09, pending_close_timestamp 2025-09-30T18:00:00. Supporting resource r_9f9f50df401c67a42ca82ffb returns 404 'Supporting input was not staged for this assignment'. Please stage the authorized supporting cost-event rows or provide an authorized source, if possible; cannot establish source_transaction_id, event created time, amount, accounting status, lateness, or actual policy consistency without it. No source changes made. Shared registry currently has read receipts only, not cost-event work products. A same-snapshot finance read receipt points to identical public-payload hash, not additional evidence.\"}",
